INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7687520, 1259208, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the setup and the use of the small platforms for the pears. Unfortunately I think this still life if flawed because the light is coming from two directions and this works against the shape of the pears, especially on the middle and left pear. I would expect the light to nicely wrap around the pear and go from light to dark gradually to emphasise the round shape. Painting with light can be a great method to achieve that. The right pear is close but there could be some more shadow, i.e. less light, on the bottom-right.</td>', 'I like the setup and the use of the small platforms for the pears. Unfortunately I think this still life if flawed because the light is coming from two directions and this works against the shape of the pears, especially on the middle and left pear. I would expect the light to nicely wrap around the pear and go from light to dark gradually to emphasise the round shape. Painting with light can be a great method to achieve that. The right pear is close but there could be some more shadow, i.e. less light, on the bottom-right.', '2021-02-19 06:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687535, 1259219, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the depth and warm atmosphere of this image. I think it would have been better if you would have shown a bit more of the rest of the scene, by tracing some of the other flowers with your light, just a bit more, to raise them from the shadows. They are currently hardly visible (but I can see them in photoshop)</td>', 'I like the depth and warm atmosphere of this image. I think it would have been better if you would have shown a bit more of the rest of the scene, by tracing some of the other flowers with your light, just a bit more, to raise them from the shadows. They are currently hardly visible (but I can see them in photoshop)', '2021-02-19 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687538, 1259090, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am impressed by your idea and technique but the result for me is too messy still to put it in my top 3. I think I would have preferred a more unidirectional and steady tracing (if at all possible with your light source). I wonder how you got the girls to stand still so precisely while they were being traced by the light source. I like it how you used different colours for each of the girls and the blue for the object (I though she was doing her hair until I saw your title).</td>', 'I am impressed by your idea and technique but the result for me is too messy still to put it in my top 3. I think I would have preferred a more unidirectional and steady tracing (if at all possible with your light source). I wonder how you got the girls to stand still so precisely while they were being traced by the light source. I like it how you used different colours for each of the girls and the blue for the object (I though she was doing her hair until I saw your title).', '2021-02-19 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687542, 1259195, 4008, '<td valign="top">Bad? depends on what you want to achieve...true, you could have gone for more precise and stylized letters, you could have gone for a full black background (there is a  lot of detail hidden in the shadows), maybe add some other points of interest etc, but then it would not be a bad photo matching your title anymore, right? Maybe I will rate it higher later because of all this, I think I need to let it sink in first before I can fully appreciate it.</td>', 'Bad? depends on what you want to achieve...true, you could have gone for more precise and stylized letters, you could have gone for a full black background (there is a  lot of detail hidden in the shadows), maybe add some other points of interest etc, but then it would not be a bad photo matching your title anymore, right? Maybe I will rate it higher later because of all this, I think I need to let it sink in first before I can fully appreciate it.', '2021-02-19 12:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687545, 1259072, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and lines but it seems to be about the effect only.</td>', 'Nice colours and lines but it seems to be about the effect only.', '2021-02-19 12:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687549, 1259128, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the more traditional approach. The pictures in the book, the roses, I am wondering about the meaning (which is good in my view, if an image does that). Nice soft spot placed with the light. Maybe a short burst of light very low across the coloured cloth could have added a bit more texture and appeal.</td>', 'I like the more traditional approach. The pictures in the book, the roses, I am wondering about the meaning (which is good in my view, if an image does that). Nice soft spot placed with the light. Maybe a short burst of light very low across the coloured cloth could have added a bit more texture and appeal.', '2021-02-19 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687556, 1259206, 4008, '<td valign="top">I love how the light strikes low across the surface and brings out the structure, plus the light inside the box.</td>', 'I love how the light strikes low across the surface and brings out the structure, plus the light inside the box.', '2021-02-19 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687557, 1259218, 4008, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous how both the matt and shiny chess pieces are shown here, plus the spotlight on the middle pawn.</td>', 'Gorgeous how both the matt and shiny chess pieces are shown here, plus the spotlight on the middle pawn.', '2021-02-19 14:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687558, 1259137, 4008, '<td valign="top">That must have been a real dark environment. It must have taken quite some  time to fully trace the lines of the BMW. I like the idea and execution, but it does not have a great appeal to me.</td>', 'That must have been a real dark environment. It must have taken quite some  time to fully trace the lines of the BMW. I like the idea and execution, but it does not have a great appeal to me.', '2021-02-19 14:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687559, 1259153, 4008, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous combination of sunset and painting with light, a short window of opportunity. Beautiful result.</td>', 'Gorgeous combination of sunset and painting with light, a short window of opportunity. Beautiful result.', '2021-02-19 14:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687562, 1258870, 4008, '<td valign="top">Same light brush as the one with the two girls? I like the more regular tracing in this one. A pity about the light patch on the jaw.</td>', 'Same light brush as the one with the two girls? I like the more regular tracing in this one. A pity about the light patch on the jaw.', '2021-02-19 14:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687564, 1259109, 4008, '<td valign="top">I assume it fits the challenge (i.e. you have used a handheld moving light source) but there is not much (only the background) in the image that takes advantage of that, i.e. that could not be achieved with a static light source. It does not have a wow factor as result of using this special and powerful technique. That isthe reason for me to score this lower.</td>', 'I assume it fits the challenge (i.e. you have used a handheld moving light source) but there is not much (only the background) in the image that takes advantage of that, i.e. that could not be achieved with a static light source. It does not have a wow factor as result of using this special and powerful technique. That isthe reason for me to score this lower.', '2021-02-19 14:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687575, 1259072, 182284, '<td valign="top">I must know how you created this. Awesome.</td>', 'I must know how you created this. Awesome.', '2021-02-19 22:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687578, 1259210, 91360, '<td valign="top">perfect 9</td>', 'perfect 9', '2021-02-20 02:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687579, 1259153, 91360, '<td valign="top">top 3!</td>', 'top 3!', '2021-02-20 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687583, 1259210, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like it how you used the technique to add meaning to the image, rather than just trace a shape or something like that. It also results in a very attractive image. The hart is not too stylized, it is a nice warm red colour, the reflection and colour of the saxophone are beautiful. The touch of blue adds some extra interest. If someone would have been playing it, it would even have been better (currently there is no sound for the lovesong). My choice for the blue.</td>', 'I like it how you used the technique to add meaning to the image, rather than just trace a shape or something like that. It also results in a very attractive image. The hart is not too stylized, it is a nice warm red colour, the reflection and colour of the saxophone are beautiful. The touch of blue adds some extra interest. If someone would have been playing it, it would even have been better (currently there is no sound for the lovesong). My choice for the blue.', '2021-02-20 06:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687633, 1259210, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. Perfection with the hearts. My top one so far.</td>', 'This is amazing. Perfection with the hearts. My top one so far.', '2021-02-21 01:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
