(7687640, 1259128, 182284, '<td valign="top">I love the setting and lighting. I may would of liked the scarf a little less colorful.</td>', 'I love the setting and lighting. I may would of liked the scarf a little less colorful.', '2021-02-21 01:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
