(7687973, 1259218, 100773, '<td valign="top">1...c5 from me. The "black" pieces suits this technique better. all eht hightligs in the white pieces makes the photo a bit messy for my taste. It could potentially look cleaner if you had desaturated the reds and yellows a bit, removing the yellow color cast from the white pieces. Then the white hightligs would blend in better on the whiter white pieces. Desaturating the green sider could also make the glass look "glassier".</td>', '1...c5 from me. The "black" pieces suits this technique better. all eht hightligs in the white pieces makes the photo a bit messy for my taste. It could potentially look cleaner if you had desaturated the reds and yellows a bit, removing the yellow color cast from the white pieces. Then the white hightligs would blend in better on the whiter white pieces. Desaturating the green sider could also make the glass look "glassier".', '2021-02-24 17:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7687974, 1259137, 100773, '<td valign="top">Using light painting as a graphical element. Who knew that would be a thing.. You did! Cool stuff! And a nice looking car as well.</td>', 'Using light painting as a graphical element. Who knew that would be a thing.. You did! Cool stuff! And a nice looking car as well.', '2021-02-24 17:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
