(7688051, 1259210, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very well done especially as a last minute entry! Yes it would have been interesting to have the musician in the scene but obviously difficult to have others around to use in this day and age. You did great with what you had. Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Very well done especially as a last minute entry! Yes it would have been interesting to have the musician in the scene but obviously difficult to have others around to use in this day and age. You did great with what you had. Congrats on the blue!', '2021-02-26 06:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
